Z||000000||AusFiero||07-25-2001||07:27 PM||||Well guys I have been chasing up a few things and doing stuff for a fair few of you of late but today stuff I was going to do has been put on hold. I have been pushing a little too hard. LTIChopTop your wheel got dropped off for the adaptor, boss wasn't there so I will confirm Monday still for shipping unless he rings and tells me otherwise. I haven't charged you for it yet.<P>Other people I have been doing stuff for well today is a no goer. I NEED REST. I have been pushin myself a little too hard the last 3 days so I am gunna kick back and relax. So no talking to the printer today either about the gauge faces people are eagerly awaiting. <P>Still recovering great from the surgery but I am sure yas can understand my position. <P>Cheers<BR>Jim<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
