Z||000003||AusFiero||07-25-2001||08:00 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by grinthock:<BR><B>DAmmit AUS!!! We keep telling you!! TAKE A BREAK!!! <P>Before you run for your break, either find someone to do it for you, or modify your WWW site to mention that orders will be delayed, helps people understand so they don't get PO'd</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Haven't had any orders through the site of late Grinthock. More direct sales through here really. If people do order though on the store I just email them personally and explain the situation. I like to keep things personal and one on one for best service. <P>Coding is the last thing I want to do today. My idea of rest will be nap this arvo. Spending the morning reading the forum and generally not thinking much  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Is mostly the brain strain. Physically I feel good. <P>||||reg||1
