Z||000008||Black88GT||07-26-2001||06:32 PM||||Aus, when should I expect those door pod speaker enclosures?  No rush just curious.<P>thx.||||reg||5
Z||000009||AusFiero||07-26-2001||06:43 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Black88GT:<BR><B>Aus, when should I expect those door pod speaker enclosures?  No rush just curious.<P>thx.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Sorry Black88GT. You must not have got my email before I had surgery. I had a set to send on  the day I was going into hospital but I was not happy with the quality as the glass guy had put lots of nicks and gouges in the finish. I haven't had a chance to go back out and pick up more sets as it is a fair way from home. I will get my wife to pick up some sets Monday and ship and process the order then. The ones I had I wouldn't sell to anyone and felt right about it.<P>I really apoligise for that man. It had slipped my mind since I got out of hospital that there was still an order pending on pods. <P>Thanks for the reminder and I will chuck in as a little bonus Aussie car mag for you. <P>Aus Slaps himself on the forehead and goes D'oh<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
