Z||000011||Monkeyman||07-26-2001||10:42 PM||||I bought some Kenwood KFC-P503 components.  They have a great sound.  I paid around $150US from Crutchfield.  One of the reasons I chose these is because they have a very shallow mounting depth.  I didn't want to cut into my newly recovered door panels.  I'll take some pics of them once I get my interior back together (hopefully this weekend).<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
